---
title: TextPart markdown
id: migrate-text-part-markdown
order: 6
description: "Move TextPart off remarkPlugins and rehypePlugins onto TanStack Markdown."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - TextPart
  - markdown
  - migration
  - breaking changes
---
