{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TL;DR:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" This is a breaking change. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TextPart"},{"type":"text","value":" no longer accepts "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remarkPlugins"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rehypePlugins"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"disableDefaultPlugins"},{"type":"text","value":". Pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"extensions"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"highlighter"},{"type":"text","value":" instead. Default "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<TextPart content={...} />"},{"type":"text","value":" still type-checks. Bare URLs stay plain text. Raw HTML in the model is escaped."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TextPart"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-react/ui"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-vue/ui"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-solid/ui"},{"type":"text","value":" now renders with "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/markdown","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Markdown"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This page is only for people who already import that component. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createChatHook"},{"type":"text","value":" does not use it unless you pass it as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"partsComponents.text"},{"type":"text","value":". Deprecated "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChatMessage"},{"type":"text","value":" still prints plain text."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"who-this-hits","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Who this hits"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You passed "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remarkPlugins"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rehypePlugins"},{"type":"text","value":", or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"disableDefaultPlugins"},{"type":"text","value":". Type-check fails."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You passed Solid "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"components"},{"type":"text","value":". Type-check fails. React "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"components"},{"type":"text","value":" stays, with a new type."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"You used default "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TextPart"},{"type":"text","value":" with only "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"content"},{"type":"text","value":". It compiles. Output can look different (see "},{"type":"link","href":"#silent-changes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Silent changes"}]},{"type":"text","value":")."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"prop-map","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prop map"}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Old prop"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"New prop"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remarkPlugins"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"extensions"},{"type":"text","value":" ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MarkdownExtension[]"},{"type":"text","value":" from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/markdown"},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rehypePlugins"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"extensions"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"highlighter"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"disableDefaultPlugins"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"gone. The streaming extension is always on"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"components"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"gone"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"components"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"components"},{"type":"text","value":" ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MarkdownComponents"},{"type":"text","value":": a tag-name map with normal HTML props)"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A unified plugin such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remark-gfm"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"remark-cjk-friendly"},{"type":"text","value":" is not a TanStack Markdown extension. You cannot pass it through."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"replace-plugin-props","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Replace plugin props"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"cjk-bold","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CJK bold"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Markdown parses CJK bold with no plugin."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\nimport remarkCjkFriendly from 'remark-cjk-friendly'\n\n<TextPart content={content} remarkPlugins={[remarkCjkFriendly]} />","lang":"tsx","meta":"ignore"},{"type":"code","value":"import { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\n\nexport function Reply({ content }: { content: string }) {\n  return <TextPart content={content} />\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"syntax-highlighting","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Syntax highlighting"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The old stack ran "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rehype-highlight"},{"type":"text","value":", then "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"rehype-sanitize"},{"type":"text","value":" stripped the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"hljs-*"},{"type":"text","value":" classes. Fenced code already looked plain."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To get colors now, pass a TanStack Highlight callback. Full steps: "},{"type":"link","href":"../ui/markdown","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Highlight markdown code"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","value":"<TextPart content={content} />","lang":"tsx","meta":"ignore"},{"type":"code","value":"import { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\nimport { highlightMarkdownCode } from './markdown-highlighter'\n\nexport function Reply({ content }: { content: string }) {\n  return (\n    <TextPart\n      content={content}\n      highlighter={highlightMarkdownCode}\n      className=\"markdown-renderer\"\n    />\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"extra-remark-or-rehype-plugins","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extra remark or rehype plugins"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"There is no drop-in for a unified plugin. Rewrite the behavior as a TanStack Markdown "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"extension"},{"type":"text","value":", or handle it outside "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TextPart"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"disableDefaultPlugins"},{"type":"text","value":" is gone. You cannot turn off the streaming extension."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"react-components","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"components"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React still accepts "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"components"},{"type":"text","value":". The type is no longer "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"react-markdown"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Components"},{"type":"text","value":". TanStack Markdown passes intrinsic HTML props only."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A common override still type-checks, then mis-renders. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"inline"},{"type":"text","value":" is always "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"code","value":"<TextPart\n  content={content}\n  components={{\n    code: ({ inline, children }) =>\n      inline ? <code>{children}</code> : <pre>{children}</pre>,\n  }}\n/>","lang":"tsx","meta":"ignore"},{"type":"code","value":"import { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\n\nexport function Reply({ content }: { content: string }) {\n  return (\n    <TextPart\n      content={content}\n      components={{\n        a: (props) => <a {...props} target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" />,\n      }}\n    />\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Branch on "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"className"},{"type":"text","value":" (for example "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"language-ts"},{"type":"text","value":") if you need fence vs inline. Do not read "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"inline"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"node"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"silent-changes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Silent changes"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"These happen with default "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<TextPart content={...} />"},{"type":"text","value":". There is no type error."}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Input"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"After"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bare URL "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"https://example.com"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Auto-linked"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Plain text"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Raw HTML such as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<br>"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<img>"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sanitized, then rendered"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Escaped text"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Task list"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"contains-task-list"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"task-list-item"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Checkbox on a plain "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<li>"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fenced code"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Plain (highlight classes stripped)"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Plain, with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tm-code"},{"type":"text","value":" / "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"language-*"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CJK bold "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"**…。**次"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Failed without a plugin"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Works"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tables, lists, strikethrough, and fenced code still render."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"what-does-not-change","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What does not change"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createChatHook"},{"type":"text","value":" apps that render "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{part.content}"},{"type":"text","value":" themselves."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deprecated "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChatMessage"},{"type":"text","value":" text output (plain text)."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Import path: still "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-react/ui"},{"type":"text","value":" (or Vue / Solid "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/ui"},{"type":"text","value":")."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TextPart"},{"type":"text","value":" data type on messages ("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ type: 'text', content }"},{"type":"text","value":"). That is not this component."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When the type error is gone and you want colored fences, follow "},{"type":"link","href":"../ui/markdown","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Highlight markdown code"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"who-this-hits","text":"Who this hits","level":2},{"id":"prop-map","text":"Prop map","level":2},{"id":"replace-plugin-props","text":"Replace plugin props","level":2},{"id":"cjk-bold","text":"CJK bold","level":3},{"id":"syntax-highlighting","text":"Syntax highlighting","level":3},{"id":"extra-remark-or-rehype-plugins","text":"Extra remark or rehype plugins","level":3},{"id":"react-components","text":"React components","level":2},{"id":"silent-changes","text":"Silent changes","level":2},{"id":"what-does-not-change","text":"What does not change","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n> **TL;DR:** This is a breaking change. `TextPart` no longer accepts `remarkPlugins`, `rehypePlugins`, or `disableDefaultPlugins`. Pass `extensions` and `highlighter` instead. Default `<TextPart content={...} />` still type-checks. Bare URLs stay plain text. Raw HTML in the model is escaped.\n\n`TextPart` from `@tanstack/ai-react/ui`, `@tanstack/ai-vue/ui`, and `@tanstack/ai-solid/ui` now renders with [TanStack Markdown](https://tanstack.com/markdown).\n\nThis page is only for people who already import that component. `createChatHook` does not use it unless you pass it as `partsComponents.text`. Deprecated `ChatMessage` still prints plain text.\n\n## Who this hits\n\n- You passed `remarkPlugins`, `rehypePlugins`, or `disableDefaultPlugins`. Type-check fails.\n- You passed Solid `components`. Type-check fails. React `components` stays, with a new type.\n- You used default `TextPart` with only `content`. It compiles. Output can look different (see [Silent changes](#silent-changes)).\n\n## Prop map\n\n| Old prop | New prop |\n| --- | --- |\n| `remarkPlugins` | `extensions` (`MarkdownExtension[]` from `@tanstack/markdown`) |\n| `rehypePlugins` | `extensions` or `highlighter` |\n| `disableDefaultPlugins` | gone. The streaming extension is always on |\n| Solid `components` | gone |\n| React `components` | `components` (`MarkdownComponents`: a tag-name map with normal HTML props) |\n\nA unified plugin such as `remark-gfm` or `remark-cjk-friendly` is not a TanStack Markdown extension. You cannot pass it through.\n\n## Replace plugin props\n\n### CJK bold\n\nTanStack Markdown parses CJK bold with no plugin.\n\n```tsx ignore\nimport { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\nimport remarkCjkFriendly from 'remark-cjk-friendly'\n\n<TextPart content={content} remarkPlugins={[remarkCjkFriendly]} />\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\n\nexport function Reply({ content }: { content: string }) {\n  return <TextPart content={content} />\n}\n```\n\n### Syntax highlighting\n\nThe old stack ran `rehype-highlight`, then `rehype-sanitize` stripped the `hljs-*` classes. Fenced code already looked plain.\n\nTo get colors now, pass a TanStack Highlight callback. Full steps: [Highlight markdown code](../ui/markdown).\n\n```tsx ignore\n<TextPart content={content} />\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\nimport { highlightMarkdownCode } from './markdown-highlighter'\n\nexport function Reply({ content }: { content: string }) {\n  return (\n    <TextPart\n      content={content}\n      highlighter={highlightMarkdownCode}\n      className=\"markdown-renderer\"\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Extra remark or rehype plugins\n\nThere is no drop-in for a unified plugin. Rewrite the behavior as a TanStack Markdown `extension`, or handle it outside `TextPart`.\n\n`disableDefaultPlugins` is gone. You cannot turn off the streaming extension.\n\n## React `components`\n\nReact still accepts `components`. The type is no longer `react-markdown` `Components`. TanStack Markdown passes intrinsic HTML props only.\n\nA common override still type-checks, then mis-renders. `inline` is always `undefined`.\n\n```tsx ignore\n<TextPart\n  content={content}\n  components={{\n    code: ({ inline, children }) =>\n      inline ? <code>{children}</code> : <pre>{children}</pre>,\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\n\nexport function Reply({ content }: { content: string }) {\n  return (\n    <TextPart\n      content={content}\n      components={{\n        a: (props) => <a {...props} target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" />,\n      }}\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\nBranch on `className` (for example `language-ts`) if you need fence vs inline. Do not read `inline` or `node`.\n\n## Silent changes\n\nThese happen with default `<TextPart content={...} />`. There is no type error.\n\n| Input | Before | After |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Bare URL `https://example.com` | Auto-linked | Plain text |\n| Raw HTML such as `<br>` or `<img>` | Sanitized, then rendered | Escaped text |\n| Task list | `contains-task-list` / `task-list-item` | Checkbox on a plain `<li>` |\n| Fenced code | Plain (highlight classes stripped) | Plain, with `tm-code` / `language-*` |\n| CJK bold `**…。**次` | Failed without a plugin | Works |\n\nTables, lists, strikethrough, and fenced code still render.\n\n## What does not change\n\n- `createChatHook` apps that render `{part.content}` themselves.\n- Deprecated `ChatMessage` text output (plain text).\n- Import path: still `@tanstack/ai-react/ui` (or Vue / Solid `/ui`).\n- The `TextPart` data type on messages (`{ type: 'text', content }`). That is not this component.\n\nWhen the type error is gone and you want colored fences, follow [Highlight markdown code](../ui/markdown).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: TextPart markdown\nid: migrate-text-part-markdown\norder: 6\ndescription: \"Move TextPart off remarkPlugins and rehypePlugins onto TanStack Markdown.\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - TextPart\n  - markdown\n  - migration\n  - breaking changes\n---\n\n> **TL;DR:** This is a breaking change. `TextPart` no longer accepts `remarkPlugins`, `rehypePlugins`, or `disableDefaultPlugins`. Pass `extensions` and `highlighter` instead. Default `<TextPart content={...} />` still type-checks. Bare URLs stay plain text. Raw HTML in the model is escaped.\n\n`TextPart` from `@tanstack/ai-react/ui`, `@tanstack/ai-vue/ui`, and `@tanstack/ai-solid/ui` now renders with [TanStack Markdown](https://tanstack.com/markdown).\n\nThis page is only for people who already import that component. `createChatHook` does not use it unless you pass it as `partsComponents.text`. Deprecated `ChatMessage` still prints plain text.\n\n## Who this hits\n\n- You passed `remarkPlugins`, `rehypePlugins`, or `disableDefaultPlugins`. Type-check fails.\n- You passed Solid `components`. Type-check fails. React `components` stays, with a new type.\n- You used default `TextPart` with only `content`. It compiles. Output can look different (see [Silent changes](#silent-changes)).\n\n## Prop map\n\n| Old prop | New prop |\n| --- | --- |\n| `remarkPlugins` | `extensions` (`MarkdownExtension[]` from `@tanstack/markdown`) |\n| `rehypePlugins` | `extensions` or `highlighter` |\n| `disableDefaultPlugins` | gone. The streaming extension is always on |\n| Solid `components` | gone |\n| React `components` | `components` (`MarkdownComponents`: a tag-name map with normal HTML props) |\n\nA unified plugin such as `remark-gfm` or `remark-cjk-friendly` is not a TanStack Markdown extension. You cannot pass it through.\n\n## Replace plugin props\n\n### CJK bold\n\nTanStack Markdown parses CJK bold with no plugin.\n\n```tsx ignore\nimport { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\nimport remarkCjkFriendly from 'remark-cjk-friendly'\n\n<TextPart content={content} remarkPlugins={[remarkCjkFriendly]} />\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\n\nexport function Reply({ content }: { content: string }) {\n  return <TextPart content={content} />\n}\n```\n\n### Syntax highlighting\n\nThe old stack ran `rehype-highlight`, then `rehype-sanitize` stripped the `hljs-*` classes. Fenced code already looked plain.\n\nTo get colors now, pass a TanStack Highlight callback. Full steps: [Highlight markdown code](../ui/markdown).\n\n```tsx ignore\n<TextPart content={content} />\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\nimport { highlightMarkdownCode } from './markdown-highlighter'\n\nexport function Reply({ content }: { content: string }) {\n  return (\n    <TextPart\n      content={content}\n      highlighter={highlightMarkdownCode}\n      className=\"markdown-renderer\"\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Extra remark or rehype plugins\n\nThere is no drop-in for a unified plugin. Rewrite the behavior as a TanStack Markdown `extension`, or handle it outside `TextPart`.\n\n`disableDefaultPlugins` is gone. You cannot turn off the streaming extension.\n\n## React `components`\n\nReact still accepts `components`. The type is no longer `react-markdown` `Components`. TanStack Markdown passes intrinsic HTML props only.\n\nA common override still type-checks, then mis-renders. `inline` is always `undefined`.\n\n```tsx ignore\n<TextPart\n  content={content}\n  components={{\n    code: ({ inline, children }) =>\n      inline ? <code>{children}</code> : <pre>{children}</pre>,\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n```tsx\nimport { TextPart } from '@tanstack/ai-react/ui'\n\nexport function Reply({ content }: { content: string }) {\n  return (\n    <TextPart\n      content={content}\n      components={{\n        a: (props) => <a {...props} target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" />,\n      }}\n    />\n  )\n}\n```\n\nBranch on `className` (for example `language-ts`) if you need fence vs inline. Do not read `inline` or `node`.\n\n## Silent changes\n\nThese happen with default `<TextPart content={...} />`. There is no type error.\n\n| Input | Before | After |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Bare URL `https://example.com` | Auto-linked | Plain text |\n| Raw HTML such as `<br>` or `<img>` | Sanitized, then rendered | Escaped text |\n| Task list | `contains-task-list` / `task-list-item` | Checkbox on a plain `<li>` |\n| Fenced code | Plain (highlight classes stripped) | Plain, with `tm-code` / `language-*` |\n| CJK bold `**…。**次` | Failed without a plugin | Works |\n\nTables, lists, strikethrough, and fenced code still render.\n\n## What does not change\n\n- `createChatHook` apps that render `{part.content}` themselves.\n- Deprecated `ChatMessage` text output (plain text).\n- Import path: still `@tanstack/ai-react/ui` (or Vue / Solid `/ui`).\n- The `TextPart` data type on messages (`{ type: 'text', content }`). That is not this component.\n\nWhen the type error is gone and you want colored fences, follow [Highlight markdown code](../ui/markdown).\n"}
